    {
      "type": "ai-inferred",
      "name": "Card assessment (DEC-356)",
      "detail": "Board-approved swap: +Terrasymbiosis / -Cultivate. Terrasymbiosis converts the deck's bulk counter placements into a repeatable, wrath-resilient draw engine; Cultivate cut as redundant ramp (Kodama's Reach retains the identical tapped-fetch + land-to-hand effect), ramp was the only over-target role."
    },
    {
      "type": "ai-inferred",
      "name": "Card assessment (DEC-359)",
      "detail": "Board-approved swap: +Turbulent Wilderness / -1 Forest (13->12). Fetchable G/U dual (Forest Island types — grabbable by Nature's Lore/Three Visits); its 'enters tapped unless opponents control 8+ lands' clause counts all opponents combined, so in a 4-player pod it enters untapped from ~turn 3. Manabase polish over a basic; colors and spell composition unchanged."
    },
    {
      "type": "ai-inferred",
      "name": "Card assessment (DEC-359)",
      "detail": "Assessed and declined: Mockingbird (clone copies printed stats not counters — ignores the deck's doubler/Ascendancy engine; keep Managorger Hydra as a doubler-multiplied counter snowball)."
    },
    {
      "type": "ai-inferred",
      "name": "Card assessment (DEC-356)",
      "detail": "Board-approved swap: +Fierce Guardianship / -An Offer You Can't Refuse. Free hard counter (noncreature) while Zimone is on the battlefield — the deck's normal state — and removes An Offer's two-Treasure donation to the caster. Adds the deck's 2nd Game Changer (gameChangers 1->2), legal at Bracket 4. Both counter noncreature spells only, so counter count and role coverage are unchanged."
    }
  ],
  "guideContent": {
    "strategyOverview": "Exponential Growth is the +1/+1 counters / Hydra go-big build of Zimone, Infinite Analyst — a Bracket-4 Simic deck whose plan is to cast X-cost Hydras and X-creatures (the first X-spell each turn grows Zimone by two counters and is discounted by {1} per counter on her), multiply those counters with stacked doublers (Doubling Season, Unbound Flourishing, Branching Evolution, Innkeeper's Talent, Kalonian Hydra), and close through oversized trample combat, an unblockable counters alpha-strike (Herald of Secret Streams), an overrun (Pathbreaker Ibex, Finale of Devastation at X≥10), or the Simic Ascendancy alternate win. It is deliberately distinct from the existing Calculated Infinity (X-spell storm/combo) Zimone deck: this is a resilient creature-combat midrange deck, not a combo deck (0 unintended infinite combos). Built under an owned-collection constraint — 11 strategy-specific cards to acquire, everything else owned or a generic staple.",
